-[28px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.5px]\">What students get</h2><div class=\"mt-6 grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4\"><div class=\"rounded-[20px] border border-black/10 bg-white/60 p-5 md:p-6\"><h3 class=\"text-[17px] md:text-[19px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.3px]\">All deals for 49 NOK a month</h3><p class=\"text-black/65 text-[15px] leading-relaxed mt-1.5\">One subscription unlocks every deal in the app — 2-for-1 mains, fixed-krone discounts, free items and gift cards. No hidden fees, and you can cancel anytime.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-[20px] border border-black/10 bg-white/60 p-5 md:p-6\"><h3 class=\"text-[17px] md:text-[19px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.3px]\">Free stamp cards</h3><p class=\"text-black/65 text-[15px] leading-relaxed mt-1.5\">Loyalty stamp cards at coffee shops, bakeries and restaurants are free for everyone — no subscription needed. Collect stamps and earn a reward after a set number of purchases.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-[20px] border border-black/10 bg-white/60 p-5 md:p-6\"><h3 class=\"text-[17px] md:text-[19px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.3px]\">Your uni email may unlock Premium</h3><p class=\"text-black/65 text-[15px] leading-relaxed mt-1.5\">Some universities and employers have approved email domains that unlock BIMM Premium at no cost. Verify your university or work email in the app to check — access is re-confirmed periodically.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-[20px] border border-black/10 bg-white/60 p-5 md:p-6\"><h3 class=\"text-[17px] md:text-[19px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.3px]\">Invite a friend</h3><p class=\"text-black/65 text-[15px] leading-relaxed mt-1.5\">Invite a friend to BIMM and you each get a month of Premium free.</p></div></div></section><div class=\"mt-10 rounded-[20px] border border-black/10 bg-white/60 p-5 md:p-6\"><p class=\"text-[13px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-black/50 mb-1.5\">The math</p><p class=\"text-[16px] md:text-[18px] font-medium max-w-[760px]\">75 of the 100 live Oslo deals save you more than a month of BIMM Premium (49 NOK) in a single visit. Pay yearly (295 NOK — 24.58 NOK/month) and that monthly cost is roughly halved.</p></div><section class=\"mt-14\"><h2 class=\"text-[22px] md:text-[28px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.5px]\">Cheap eats for campus life</h2><p class=\"text-black/60 text-[15px] mt-2 max-w-[760px]\">Coffee for the reading room, pizza with your study group or a burger after lectures — here are the BIMM categories that fit student life, with venues and deals pulled live.</p><div class=\"mt-6 grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4\"><div class=\"rounded-[20px] border border-black/10 bg-white/60 p-5 self-start\"><h3 class=\"text-[13px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-black/50\">Coffee shops</h3><p class=\"text-[13px] text-black/50 mt-0.5\">36 venues in this category</p><ul class=\"mt-3 flex flex-col gap-2.5\"><li class=\"text-[15px] leading-snug\"><a class=\"font-medium hover:underline\" href=\"https://bimm.app/location/sweetmint-grunerlokka\">Sweetmint Grünerløkka</a><span class=\"block text-black/70 text-[14px] mt-0.5\">Save 95 NOK</span></li><li class=\"text-[15px] leading-snug\"><a class=\"font-medium hover:underline\" href=\"https://bimm.app/location/twintea\">Twintea</a><span class=\"block text-black/70 text-[14px] mt-0.5\">2 for 1 — save approx 83 NOK</span></li><li class=\"text-[15px] leading-snug\"><a class=\"font-medium hover:underline\" href=\"https://bimm.app/location/the-fragrance-of-the-heart-majorstuen\">The Fragrance of the Heart - Majorstuen</a><span class=\"block text-black/70 text-[14px] mt-0.5\">Save 110 NOK</span></li></ul></div><div class=\"rounded-[20px] border border-black/10 bg-white/60 p-5 self-start\"><h3 class=\"text-[13px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-black/50\">Bakeries</h3><p class=\"text-[13px] text-black/50 mt-0.5\">13 venues in this category</p><ul class=\"mt-3 flex flex-col gap-2.5\"><li class=\"text-[15px] leading-snug\"><a class=\"font-medium hover:underline\" href=\"https://bimm.app/location/bonbon-oslo\">BonBon Oslo</a><span class=\"block text-black/70 text-[14px] mt-0.5\">Save 100 NOK</span></li><li class=\"text-[15px] leading-snug\"><a class=\"font-medium hover:underline\" href=\"https://bimm.app/location/boulangerie-m-skoyen\">Boulangerie M Skøyen</a><span class=\"block text-black/70 text-[14px] mt-0.5\">Save 40 NOK</span></li><li class=\"text-[15px] leading-snug\"><a class=\"font-medium hover:underline\" href=\"https://bimm.app/location/encore-kafe-and-konditori-oslo\">Encore Kafe &amp; Konditori Oslo</a><span class=\"block text-black/70 text-[14px] mt-0.5\">Save 26 NOK</span></li></ul></div><div class=\"rounded-[20px] border border-black/10 bg-white/60 p-5 self-start\"><h3 class=\"text-[13px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-black/50\">Pizza</h3><p class=\"text-[13px] text-black/50 mt-0.5\">9 venues in this category</p><ul class=\"mt-3 flex flex-col gap-2.5\"><li class=\"text-[15px] leading-snug\"><a class=\"font-medium hover:underline\" href=\"https://bimm.app/location/mamma-pizza-osteria-italiana\">Mamma Pizza Osteria Italiana</a><span class=\"block text-black/70 text-[14px] mt-0.5\">2 for 1 — save approx 275 NOK</span></li><li class=\"text-[15px] leading-snug\"><a class=\"font-medium hover:underline\" href=\"https://bimm.app/location/mamma-pizza-vika-osteria-di-mare\">Mamma Pizza Vika Osteria di Mare</a><span class=\"block text-black/70 text-[14px] mt-0.5\">2 for 1 — save approx 275 NOK</span></li><li class=\"text-[15px] leading-snug\"><a class=\"font-medium hover:underline\" href=\"https://bimm.app/location/haus-di-gusto\">Haus di Gusto</a><span class=\"block text-black/70 text-[14px] mt-0.5\">2 for 1 — save approx 262 NOK</span></li></ul></div><div class=\"rounded-[20px] border border-black/10 bg-white/60 p-5 self-start\"><h3 class=\"text-[13px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-black/50\">Burgers</h3><p class=\"text-[13px] text-black/50 mt-0.5\">8 venues in this category</p><ul class=\"mt-3 flex flex-col gap-2.5\"><li class=\"text-[15px] leading-snug\"><a class=\"font-medium hover:underline\" href=\"https://bimm.app/location/johnny-rockets-storo\">Johnny Rockets Storo</a><span class=\"block text-black/70 text-[14px] mt-0.5\">Save 300 NOK</span></li><li class=\"text-[15px] leading-snug\"><a class=\"font-medium hover:underline\" href=\"https://bimm.app/location/sabrura-sticks-and-sushi-valkyrien\">Sabrura Sticks &amp; Sushi Valkyrien</a><span class=\"block text-black/70 text-[14px] mt-0.5\">Save 180 NOK</span></li><li class=\"text-[15px] leading-snug\"><a class=\"font-medium hover:underline\" href=\"https://bimm.app/location/cafe-laundromat\">Café Laundromat</a><span class=\"block text-black/70 text-[14px] mt-0.5\">Save 138 NOK</span></li></ul></div><div class=\"rounded-[20px] border border-black/10 bg-white/60 p-5 self-start\"><h3 class=\"text-[13px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-black/50\">Italian</h3><p class=\"text-[13px] text-black/50 mt-0.5\">19 venues in this category</p><ul class=\"mt-3 flex flex-col gap-2.5\"><li class=\"text-[15px] leading-snug\"><a class=\"font-medium hover:underline\" href=\"https://bimm.app/location/mamma-pizza-osteria-italiana\">Mamma Pizza Osteria Italiana</a><span class=\"block text-black/70 text-[14px] mt-0.5\">2 for 1 — save approx 275 NOK</span></li><li class=\"text-[15px] leading-snug\"><a class=\"font-medium hover:underline\" href=\"https://bimm.app/location/mamma-pizza-vika-osteria-di-mare\">Mamma Pizza Vika Osteria di Mare</a><span class=\"block text-black/70 text-[14px] mt-0.5\">2 for 1 — save approx 275 NOK</span></li><li class=\"text-[15px] leading-snug\"><a class=\"font-medium hover:underline\" href=\"https://bimm.app/location/haus-di-gusto\">Haus di Gusto</a><span class=\"block text-black/70 text-[14px] mt-0.5\">2 for 1 — save approx 262 NOK</span></li></ul></div></div><a class=\"inline-block mt-6 rounded-full bg-black text-white px-6 py-3 text-[15px] font-medium hover:opacity-80 transition-opacity\" href=\"/deals/oslo\">See all deals in Oslo</a></section><section aria-label=\"Student FAQ\" class=\"mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-black/10\"><h2 class=\"text-[22px] md:text-[28px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.5px] mb-5\">Student FAQ</h2><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 max-w-[820px]\"><details class=\"group border-b border-black/10 pb-2\"><summary class=\"cursor-pointer list-none flex justify-between items-center gap-4 py-2 text-[16px] md:text-[17px] font-medium\"><span>Do restaurants in Oslo offer student discounts?</span><span class=\"text-black/40 transition-transform group-open:rotate-45 text-[22px] leading-none\">+</span></summary><p class=\"text-black/65 text-[15px] leading-relaxed pb-2 pr-8\">A few places run their own student offers, but most restaurants in Oslo have no standing student discount. For most students, deals apps are the easiest way to get member prices. BIMM costs 49 NOK/month, or 295 NOK/year (24.58 NOK/month), and unlocks every deal in the app — 2-for-1 mains, fixed-krone discounts and free items. Some universities and employers also have approved email domains that unlock BIMM Premium at no cost; verify your university or work email in the app to check.</p></details><details class=\"group border-b border-black/10 pb-2\"><summary class=\"cursor-pointer list-none flex justify-between items-center gap-4 py-2 text-[16px] md:text-[17px] font-medium\"><span>Is BIMM free for students?</span><span class=\"text-black/40 transition-transform group-open:rotate-45 text-[22px] leading-none\">+</span></summary><p class=\"text-black/65 text-[15px] leading-relaxed pb-2 pr-8\">The app is free to download, and the loyalty stamp cards are free for everyone — no subscription needed. The deals themselves require BIMM Premium — 49 NOK/month, or 295 NOK/year (24.58 NOK/month) — which you can cancel anytime. Some universities and employers have approved email domains that unlock Premium at no cost — verify your university email in the app to check. Access is re-confirmed periodically.</p></details><details class=\"group border-b border-black/10 pb-2\"><summary class=\"cursor-pointer list-none flex justify-between items-center gap-4 py-2 text-[16px] md:text-[17px] font-medium\"><span>How do I eat out cheap in Oslo as a student?</span><span class=\"text-black/40 transition-transform group-open:rotate-45 text-[22px] leading-none\">+</span></summary><p class=\"text-black/65 text-[15px] leading-relaxed pb-2 pr-8\">Plan around the deals instead of picking a place first. Split a 2-for-1 main with a friend, time your visit to the deal&#x27;s window (many apply on specific days or hours), and use the free stamp cards for the coffee and pastries you already buy. Invite a friend to BIMM and you each get a month of Premium free on top.</p></details><details class=\"group border-b border-black/10 pb-2\"><summary class=\"cursor-pointer list-none flex justify-between items-center gap-4 py-2 text-[16px] md:text-[17px] font-medium\"><span>What kinds of deals are on BIMM?</span><span class=\"text-black/40 transition-transform group-open:rotate-45 text-[22px] leading-none\">+</span></summary><p class=\"text-black/65 text-[15px] leading-relaxed pb-2 pr-8\">Deals are 2-for-1 meals, discounts of a fixed amount in kroner, free items and gift cards — plus stamp cards that earn you a reward after a set number of purchases. Some deals apply on specific days or in set time windows. Using one is simple: find the deal in the app, book a date and time, show up and check in — no coupons or codes. Deals are primarily in Oslo and a few other cities.</p></details><details class=\"group border-b border-black/10 pb-2\"><summary class=\"cursor-pointer list-none flex justify-between items-center gap-4 py-2 text-[16px] md:text-[17px] font-medium\"><span>Can I cancel anytime?</span><span class=\"text-black/40 transition-transform group-open:rotate-45 text-[22px] leading-none\">+</span></summary><p class=\"text-black/65 text-[15px] leading-relaxed pb-2 pr-8\">Yes. BIMM Premium is 49 NOK/month, or 295 NOK/year (24.58 NOK/month) — no lock-in and no hidden fees — cancel anytime. The stamp cards stay free to use without a subscription either way.</p></details></div></section></div></section><div class=\"w-full bg-ds-bg-warm py-10 lg:py-16\"><div class=\"w-full\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[1520px] px-5 md:px-10\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-[14px] lg:hidden\"><div class=\"relative rounded-[32px] overflow-hidden h-[620px]\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"100vw\" src=\"/reference/d972bdbf2cb31d3d.webp\"/><div class=\"relative z-[5] flex flex-col items-center gap-[20px] w-full pt-[23px]\"><div class=\"relative overflow-hidden shrink-0 w-[140px] h-[48px]\"><img alt=\"BIMM\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"989\" height=\"293\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/reference/85d5cf1438fe1490.webp\"/></div><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center text-center text-white gap-[12px]\"><h2 class=\"text-[42px] font-semibold leading-none tracking-[-1.68px] w-[330px]\" id=\"download\">Ready to Dine Smarter?</h2><p class=\"text-[16px] font-normal leading-[1.33] tracking-[-0.32px] w-[206px]\"><span class=\"font-bold\">Download BIMM</span> <!-- -->and start saving today!</p></div></div><img alt=\"BIMM app\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1481\" height=\"3205\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"absolute z-[2] top-[41%] left-[8%] w-[84%]\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/reference/c1c5a0f7b2ea84b6.webp\"/></div><div class=\"flex gap-2 w-full\"><a role=\"button\" target=\"_blank\" tabindex=\"0\" data-react-aria-pressable=\"true\" class=\"z-0 group relative inline-flex items-center justify-center box-border appearance-none select-none whitespace-nowrap font-normal subpixel-antialiased overflow-hidden tap-highlight-transparent transform-gpu data-[pressed=true]:scale-[0.97] cursor-pointer outlin